Day 54 of my 120-Day Data Analytics Challenge 

Today, I kicked off Case Study 7 from the 8 Week SQL Challenge...Balanced Tree Clothing Co.

In this challenge, I’m stepping into the role of a data analyst supporting the CEO and merchandising team to analyze sales performance and build a monthly financial report. 

What makes this case study exciting:
📊 Real-world retail dataset 
📈 Focus on business-driven questions (revenue, discounts, customer behavior)
🛍 Understanding product hierarchy 

Some key questions I’ll be solving:

✔️ Total revenue and discount impact.
✔️ Member vs non-member transaction behavior.
✔️ Top performing products and segments.
✔️ Product contribution to overall revenue.

Excited to dive deeper into this one and uncover insights.

